Z||000012||1FieroGTRacingInc||09-07-2000||06:49 PM||||Thank's guy's...  So Sorry StuGood...  I just started saving for a v-8..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>My car is still jerky at steady speed's... at 35 or at 75..  still the same. when i reach a speed and stay at that speed is when it is doing it...  Hey StuGood...  LOL  I might still need your part's..lol   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <BR>                          Steve||||reg||1
